{
  "id": 21,
  "name": "regret_cluster_hybrid",
  "intent": "Build on the return-aware regret seed by slightly increasing the regret weight (0.2 -> 0.25) to better identify critical bridges, and adding a small cluster_density bonus (0.1) to prefer candidates surrounded by many other unvisited cities. This balances local distance optimality with a lookahead for future flexibility (regret) and spatial awareness (density), which should help especially on uniform and grid instances where isolated or bridging nodes cause poor myopic choices.",
